# SECURITY NOTICE:
# 1. Never commit real .env, .env.local, or .env.production files to Git.
# 2. Never prefix private API keys, database credentials, or secrets with VITE_
#    (any variable prefixed with VITE_ is bundled into public browser code).
# 3. Store server-side secrets exclusively in Vercel Project Settings ->
#    Environment Variables (encrypted at rest, restricted by environment).

# Public canonical application URL (safe for public reference)
APP_URL="https://brainbenchtech.vercel.app"

